# The storyboard's mechanical panels are tracked; the memory panels are not.
# They hold personal biography and this repository is public.
storyboard/memory-*
# Character studies. Unlike the mechanical panels above, these are sketchbook
# working-out rather than design record: nothing reads them, nothing builds
# from them, and what they settled is written down in the comment on
# `bakeShadow` and in ART-DIRECTION. Committing them would grow the repository
# by megabytes every time a page gets drawn.
storyboard/shadow*
